meta {
  name: Success Callback
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/success
  body: form
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
}

body:form {
  status: VALID
  tran_id: SSL_TEST_12345678_1700000000000
  amount: 100.00
  currency: BDT
  value_a: {{orderId}}
}

docs {
  ## Payment Success Callback

  SSLCommerz IPN (Instant Payment Notification) and success redirect handler.
  Called by SSLCommerz server-side after a successful payment.

  ### Form Data
  | Parameter | Type   | Description                  |
  |-----------|--------|------------------------------|
  | status    | string | VALID or VALIDATED           |
  | tran_id   | string | Transaction ID               |
  | amount    | string | Payment amount               |
  | currency  | string | Currency code (default: BDT) |
  | value_a   | string | Order ID (embedded by us)    |

  ### Success (303 Redirect)
  Redirects to `/profile/orders/{{orderId}}?payment=success`
}
